WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.979
Count these five chalk pieces. Point to each one and say one, two, three, four, five.

00:00:05.783 --> 00:00:10.351
Start at twenty four and count by twos: twenty four, twenty six, twenty eight,

00:00:10.351 --> 00:00:11.330
thirty, thirty two.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.272
Count by tens: ten, twenty, thirty, forty, fifty.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.936
The fourth child has three children standing ahead. Fourth describes a position.
